[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/30220079","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2461#issuecomment-30220079","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2461","id":30220079,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMwMjIwMDc5","user":{"login":"ceeram","id":111448,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTQ0OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram","html_url":"https://github.com/ceeram","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceeram/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-12-10T12:04:42Z","updated_at":"2013-12-10T12:04:42Z","body":"Join table data would be by convention use DiscountGroupsUser\nOp 10 dec. 2013 12:33 schreef \"andruhapx\" notifications@github.com:\n\n> Hi all,\n> \n> I recently tried use Model::save to save data into HABTM join table. HABTM\n> model has setting 'unique' => true.\n> \n> class User extends AppModel {\n>     public $hasAndBelongsToMany = array(\n>         'DiscountGroup' => array(\n>             'with' => 'DiscountGroupsUsers',\n>             'unique' => true,\n>         ),\n>     );}\n> \n> When HABTM data is not empy it works as expected: delete from HABTM join\n> table, then insert into HABTM join table:\n> \n> $data = array('DiscountGroup'=>array(\n>     0=>array('DiscountGroupsUsers'=>array('discount_group_id'=>1, 'custom_discount_rate'=>11)),));$this->User->create();$this->User->id = $user_id;$this->User->save($data, array('validate'=>false));\n> \n> But when all checkboxes on form are unset and array with HABTM data is\n> empty, deleting is not performed (Its wrong behavior I think):\n> \n> $data = array('DiscountGroup'=>array());$this->User->create();$this->User->id = $user_id;$this->User->save($data, array('validate'=>false));\n> \n> I checked in code and I see that issue is in Model::set that is called\n> from Model::save.\n> \n> public function set($one, $two = null) {\n>     ...\n>     foreach ($data as $modelName => $fieldSet) {\n>         if (is_array($fieldSet)) {\n> \n> ```\n>         foreach ($fieldSet as $fieldName => $fieldValue) {\n>             if (isset($this->validationErrors[$fieldName])) {\n>                 unset ($this->validationErrors[$fieldName]);\n>             }\n> \n>             if ($modelName === $this->alias) {\n>                 if ($fieldName === $this->primaryKey) {\n>                     $this->id = $fieldValue;\n>                 }\n>             }\n>             if (is_array($fieldValue) || is_object($fieldValue)) {\n>                 $fieldValue = $this->deconstruct($fieldName, $fieldValue);\n>             }\n>             $this->data[$modelName][$fieldName] = $fieldValue;\n>         }\n>     }\n> }\n> return $data;}\n> ```\n> \n> Models data is set as\n> \n> $this->data[$modelName][$fieldName] = $fieldValue;\n> \n> But there is no array initialization after if (is_array($fieldSet)) check\n> \n> if (!isset($this->data[$modelName]))\n>     $this->data[$modelName] = array();\n> \n> —\n> Reply to this email directly or view it on GitHubhttps://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2461\n> .\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/30220079/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed